---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="谢谢 — 询盘已发送 | MeshCalculator" lang="zh" noindex>
  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-24 text-center">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold">询盘已发送 ✅</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-theme-secondary">匹配的安平工厂将直接回复您的邮箱，通常在 24–48 小时内。</p>
    <a href="/zh/" class="inline-block mt-8 bg-theme-secondary text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-theme-tertiary transition-colors">返回首页</a>
  </section>
</Base>
